{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19844","headline":"感怀 四 · 孟郊","name":"感怀 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安佳丽地，宫月生蛾眉。\n阴气凝万里，坐看芳草衰。\n玉堂有玄鸟，亦以从此辞。\n伤哉志士叹，故国多迟迟。\n深宫岂无乐，扰扰复何爲。\n朝见名与利，莫还生是非。\n姜牙佐周武，世业永巍巍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}